      "quote": "May contain strong violence, heavy realistic blood, moderate crude humor, romantic themes, unplayable gambling content, the presence of alcohol, strong language, social hangouts and private spaces, extended AI interactions, and/or moderate fear."
    },
    {
      "ref": "[D535]",
      "area": "contact",
      "claim": "A parent reports that users must still comply with Roblox’s Restricted Content Policy and Community Standards, and that language used to harass, discriminate, incite violence, or threaten others, or used in a sexual context is not allowed.",
      "stance": "mitigation",
      "quote": "Strong language policies will apply to both in-experience content and how users communicate within text and voice chat. Users must still comply with Roblox’s [Restricted Content Policy](/hc/en-us/articles/15869919570708) and [Community Standards](/hc/en-us/articles/203313410). Roblox won’t allow language that is used to harass, discriminate, incite violence, or threaten others, or used in a sexual context."
